# 18. Risks and Mitigation

| Risk | Mitigation |
| --- | --- |
| Extracted procedure is wrong | Human review + citations required before export |
| Knowledge in heads never captured | Structured elicitation prompts |
| Skill goes stale | Freshness engine + contradiction detection |
| Agent acts unsafely | Guardrails, approval gates, audit |
| "Just a chatbot" drift | Deliverable is the skill file; review UI stays a support tool, not the product |

